              <li>G2 rates it 3.5/5 from 84 reviews, and Trustpilot has only two old reviews</li>
              <li>A 2026 hands-on test found the AI builder looped for 30+ minutes without finishing</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-accent);font-weight:600;">
          Pricing: Agent Essential $59/month or $566/year · Agent Plus $79/month or $758/year · Agent Premier $129/month or $1,238/year · Team $199/month · Broker Standard $399/month · Broker Plus $599/month · IDX Support Fee $25/month per active MLS contract, plus your MLS access fee · Setup $300 Professional / $500 Semi-Custom / $1,200 Custom, one-time · Do It For Me from $75/month · Content Automation from $15/month · Extra website $25/month · No contract, 14 day free trial, 20% off annual (verified on placester.com pricing and services pages, November 2026)
        </p>
