uded), the Text Receptionist ($297), the Voice Receptionist ($550 + Vapi ~$30-50/month), the Verified Prospect List ($497/$997), the Lead Generation Pack ($1,997), the Custom Assessment ($349/$999), websites ($499/$999/$1,999), the CMS add-on ($130), the Content Engine ($497), Content Booster ($149/month) and optional care at $97/month or $197/month. Prices and features change; check both vendors' own pages before you buy.
        </p>
      </div>

